import auth.rest

run #login


### Job Portal - Resume Service API Tests
### IntelliJ IDEA HTTP Client

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5004
@candidateId = 1
@resumeId = 1

### ==================== RESUMES ====================

### 1. Create a resume
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Java Backend Developer Resume",
  "template": "PROFESSIONAL",
  "visibility": "PUBLIC",
  "isDefault": true
}

### 2. Get my active resumes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/my
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}

### 3. Get resume by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}

### 4. Update resume
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Java Backend Developer Resume",
  "template": "PROFESSIONAL",
  "visibility": "PUBLIC",
  "isDefault": true
}

### 5. Update personal information
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}/personal-info
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "headline": "Java Backend Developer",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "phone": "+3725550123",
  "city": "Tallinn",
  "country": "Estonia",
  "linkedinUrl": "https://linkedin.com/in/johnsmith",
  "githubUrl": "https://github.com/johnsmith",
  "portfolioUrl": "https://johnsmith.example.com",
  "websiteUrl": "https://example.com"
}

### 6. Update resume summary
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}/summary
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}
Content-Type: text/plain

Java backend developer with experience in Java 21, Spring Boot, PostgreSQL and microservices.

### 7. Set as default resume
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}/default
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}

### 8. Delete resume (soft delete - run last)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/resumes/{{resumeId}}
X-User-Id: {{candidateId}}

